    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="struct_live_debug_values_1_1_dbg_op" kindref="compound">DbgOp</ref> whose <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> (if any) has resolved to an actual location, <ref refid="class_live_debug_values_1_1_loc_idx" kindref="compound">LocIdx</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used when working with concrete debug values, i.e. when joining MLocs and VLocs in the <ref refid="class_transfer_tracker" kindref="compound">TransferTracker</ref> or emitting DBG_VALUE/DBG_VALUE_LIST instructions in the <ref refid="class_live_debug_values_1_1_m_loc_tracker" kindref="compound">MLocTracker</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
